01:31.327 --> 01:36.327
Sasuke's Answer

01:57.777 --> 01:58.777
This time...

01:59.237 --> 02:00.817
you're not going to
reach the other side!

02:25.447 --> 02:26.657
I'm the one still standing.

02:27.907 --> 02:29.447
Opposite from the last time.

02:31.567 --> 02:32.777
I just want to protect...

02:34.197 --> 02:35.697
the dream I finally realized.

02:35.777 --> 02:38.237
I don't want anymore...

02:40.277 --> 02:43.657
You look pretty depressed, Hashirama.

02:44.657 --> 02:46.867
Can't perk back up this time, eh?

02:54.197 --> 02:58.367
<i>Can't we show each other</i>
<i>our guts?</i>

02:58.617 --> 03:01.197
<i>The first steps are for us to</i>
<i>not give up on our ideals</i>

03:01.277 --> 03:03.527
<i>and to get a lot stronger.</i>

03:04.317 --> 03:06.527
<i>Let's build our settlement here!</i>

03:10.567 --> 03:13.617
<i>They say where there's a will,</i>
<i>there's a way...</i>

03:13.697 --> 03:14.697
<i>And yet, I...</i>

03:15.197 --> 03:17.027
<i>That dream is now becoming reality.</i>

03:41.487 --> 03:43.987
A Wood Style Clone...

03:45.527 --> 03:48.567
I can't believe my back was taken...

03:48.867 --> 03:53.317
I will protect our... no, my village.

03:54.237 --> 03:55.737
No matter what.

03:56.487 --> 03:58.987
I still believe to this day
that protecting the village

03:59.067 --> 04:04.487
will lead to the protection of
the people, shinobi, and children!

04:05.617 --> 04:11.447
I will not forgive anyone
who threatens the village.

04:11.527 --> 04:14.527
Be they a friend... sibling...
or even my own child...

04:17.987 --> 04:20.527
You've changed... Hashirama.

04:22.657 --> 04:25.617
<i>I made up my mind right then...</i>

04:25.737 --> 04:29.567
<i>to endure in order to watch</i>
<i>over the present.</i>

04:31.277 --> 04:33.027
You've got your priorities backwards.

04:33.697 --> 04:37.817
Ultimately... It shall someday
lead the village to darkness.

04:56.697 --> 05:00.617
<i>And thus... my battle with Madara</i>
<i>came to an end.</i>

05:01.617 --> 05:04.817
I don't know how Madara
returned to life now.

05:05.067 --> 05:07.617
I definitely killed my friend...

05:08.487 --> 05:09.617
For the sake of the village.

05:15.367 --> 05:16.237
That's right...

05:16.867 --> 05:17.947
The village...

05:18.777 --> 05:22.117
that Madara and I first envisioned...

05:22.907 --> 05:25.527
is something that joined
one clan to another.

05:26.067 --> 05:28.737
It was an invaluable cornerstone
that created order out of chaos,

05:28.817 --> 05:31.527
then maintained it.

05:32.697 --> 05:36.027
It protected the children and
averted pointless conflict.

05:36.117 --> 05:38.277
It made peace a reality.

05:38.947 --> 05:41.527
However... it gave rise to despair,

05:41.617 --> 05:44.617
the kind that your brother Itachi
was forced to bear.

05:46.907 --> 05:49.527
Perhaps what Madara said
was correct, after all.

05:50.617 --> 05:53.157
Perhaps he foresaw
this state of affairs.

05:54.277 --> 05:57.527
I am the shinobi who created
these circumstances.

05:57.617 --> 06:02.487
Furthermore, I am also the one
who considered them acceptable.

06:03.487 --> 06:07.317
I believe that shinobi are those
who endure for a purpose.

06:07.617 --> 06:10.617
But depending on what that purpose is,
a shinobi can change.

06:10.987 --> 06:13.157
Just as Madara... and I did.

06:17.987 --> 06:19.697
Shinobi...

06:20.817 --> 06:23.567
Shinobi are those who endure...

06:23.947 --> 06:27.027
in order to achieve their goals.

06:27.447 --> 06:30.367
For me, it was building a village.

06:30.657 --> 06:33.487
But it seems Madara
found something else.

06:33.987 --> 06:37.407
This plan of Madara's that
Orochimaru mentioned earlier...

06:37.487 --> 06:39.487
To erase all the shinobi in this world...

06:39.487 --> 06:42.817
I don't know what
that means in literal terms, but...

06:44.117 --> 06:45.657
It's the Infinite Tsukuyomi

06:46.157 --> 06:49.407
where village, shinobi,
and citizen are all irrelevant.

06:50.367 --> 06:52.567
He intends to put everyone
under genjutsu

06:52.657 --> 06:54.947
and manipulate them as he sees fit.

06:55.617 --> 06:58.947
To negate everything that
my older brother, Madara's younger brother...

06:59.567 --> 07:02.567
and all of you...

07:03.987 --> 07:05.487
have tried to protect.

07:16.867 --> 07:24.367
My older brother inherited your will
without even talking to you.

07:27.947 --> 07:29.067
My older brother...

07:29.657 --> 07:33.527
<i>Itachi... You also serve as</i>
<i>the Uchiha Clan's pipeline</i>

07:33.527 --> 07:35.697
<i>to the Village nerve center.</i>

07:36.197 --> 07:38.027
<i>You know that, don't you?</i>

07:41.907 --> 07:45.777
Even as he shouldered that
heavy responsibility for the clan...

07:46.487 --> 07:49.487
<i>We cannot allow such a thing!</i>

07:49.487 --> 07:54.157
<i>If they are going to start a revolution</i>
<i>and usurp our power,</i>

07:54.237 --> 07:58.487
<i>we have no choice but to judge</i>
<i>the Uchiha as traitors of the Leaf!</i>

07:58.567 --> 07:59.737
<i>Wait, Koharu.</i>

08:00.567 --> 08:02.407
<i>Don't rush to such a decision.</i>

08:02.657 --> 08:06.947
<i>But Hiruzen, the Uchiha Clan</i>
<i>will not be dissuaded.</i>

08:07.617 --> 08:12.447
<i>We must take measures</i>
<i>to avoid mayhem.</i>

08:15.027 --> 08:17.777
<i>And that includes innocent children.</i>

08:18.657 --> 08:21.317
<i>Do not say such things</i>
<i>before Itachi!</i>

08:21.567 --> 08:26.567
<i>Besides, taking on the Uchiha</i>
<i>will be no easy task.</i>

08:26.697 --> 08:29.407
<i>There's got be some sort of</i>
<i>strategy we can use!</i>

08:29.817 --> 08:31.657
<i>We have no time to waste.</i>

08:32.067 --> 08:36.407
<i>We must strike preemptively,</i>
<i>before they have a chance to act.</i>

08:36.737 --> 08:40.617
<i>If we join forces with our respective</i>
<i>ANBU Black Ops</i>

08:40.697 --> 08:42.487
<i>and launch a surprise attack</i>
<i>from behind,</i>

08:42.487 --> 08:44.237
<i>it will be over in no time.</i>

08:44.867 --> 08:47.317
<i>The Uchiha are old comrades</i>
<i>in arms.</i>

08:48.527 --> 08:51.407
<i>I want to settle this with</i>
<i>words first before force.</i>

08:52.027 --> 08:54.277
<i>I will come up with a strategy.</i>

08:55.487 --> 08:56.527
<i>Itachi...</i>

08:56.987 --> 09:01.317
<i>Buy me some time,</i>
<i>however little it may be.</i>

09:02.777 --> 09:05.697
He stood between the village
and the clan in their strife...

09:08.487 --> 09:12.617
<i>I see... So you've aligned</i>
<i>with the other side?</i>

09:13.987 --> 09:16.317
<i>Father, Mother...</i>

09:17.657 --> 09:18.527
<i>I...</i>

09:18.617 --> 09:20.657
<i>I know, Itachi.</i>

09:21.367 --> 09:23.777
<i>Itachi, just promise me this.</i>

09:26.567 --> 09:28.487
<i>Take care of Sasuke.</i>

09:34.697 --> 09:35.697
<i>I will.</i>

09:38.197 --> 09:39.157
<i>Do not fear.</i>

09:39.947 --> 09:41.907
<i>This is the path you have chosen.</i>

09:43.317 --> 09:46.737
<i>Compared to you,</i>
<i>our pain will be over in an instant.</i>

09:47.907 --> 09:51.737
<i>Even if our philosophies differ,</i>
<i>I am proud of you.</i>

09:55.407 --> 09:57.527
<i>You are truly a kind child.</i>

10:04.487 --> 10:06.737
He even killed his own parents...

10:08.817 --> 10:12.447
<i>We received intel that Itachi Uchiha</i>
<i>of the Akatsuki is dead.</i>

10:13.527 --> 10:17.697
<i>Put a mark on his image and</i>
<i>remove him from your Bingo Book.</i>

10:18.487 --> 10:21.157
<i>So that traitor is dead at last.</i>

10:23.367 --> 10:27.487
<i>But Captain,</i>
<i>who was able to kill him?</i>

10:27.907 --> 10:30.527
<i>Looks like it was</i>
<i>his younger brother, Sasuke.</i>

10:31.487 --> 10:32.407
<i>How ironic...</i>

10:32.487 --> 10:35.407
<i>His own brother killed the one</i>
<i>who slaughtered their kin.</i>

10:35.657 --> 10:36.657
<i>Serves him right!</i>

10:36.737 --> 10:38.907
<i>After that atrocious thing he did!</i>

10:39.527 --> 10:41.197
<i>Not only that, he joined up</i>
<i>with the Akatsuki</i>

10:41.277 --> 10:42.987
<i>and came after the Leaf Village!</i>

10:43.447 --> 10:46.697
<i>He's the most notorious villain</i>
<i>in Hidden Leaf history!</i>

10:47.067 --> 10:50.487
<i>I wish we got our hands on him first!</i>

10:51.867 --> 10:53.567
He was forced to kill
his own clan and

10:53.657 --> 10:55.737
endure the brand as
a Rogue Ninja...

10:55.817 --> 10:57.527
Yet, he continued to keep
an eye on the organization

10:57.617 --> 10:58.777
that wanted to harm the village.

11:01.617 --> 11:04.197
And even in death...

11:04.817 --> 11:06.367
<i>I'll have protected my village</i>

11:06.447 --> 11:08.987
<i>as Itachi Uchiha</i>
<i>of the Leaf once again.</i>

11:09.067 --> 11:10.657
<i>I have no more regrets.</i>

11:12.407 --> 11:15.657
My older brother endured longer
and harder than you.

11:16.777 --> 11:21.407
And died stating he was proud
to be Leaf Shinobi.

11:23.407 --> 11:26.117
Isn't it ironic that the shinobi who
understood you more than anyone else...

11:26.197 --> 11:27.817
was from the Uchiha Clan?

11:31.027 --> 11:32.737
Your brother was not the only one.

11:34.447 --> 11:36.567
I had a subordinate
named Kagami Uchiha

11:36.657 --> 11:38.657
who was much like your brother.

11:39.317 --> 11:42.407
Second Hokage... I thought
you despised the Uchiha.

11:43.067 --> 11:44.527
That's not entirely true.

11:45.407 --> 11:47.737
I treated anyone who posed
a danger to the village,

11:47.817 --> 11:51.697
no matter what clan they belonged to,
with extreme caution.

11:52.617 --> 11:56.817
And there's no doubt that
the Uchiha Clan warranted my suspicions...

11:57.737 --> 12:00.067
The Uchiha just happened
to be a clan

12:00.157 --> 12:01.527
particularly disposed
to be considered as such.

12:01.817 --> 12:04.367
But, it is also because
they could feel such deep love

12:04.447 --> 12:06.157
that there were quite
a few Uchiha over the years

12:06.237 --> 12:07.527
like your brother and Kagami...

12:07.527 --> 12:09.277
who could transcend
the boundaries of the clan

12:09.367 --> 12:10.867
and devote themselves to the village.

12:11.657 --> 12:13.567
My elder brother believed the village

12:13.657 --> 12:16.817
was something that could
eliminate the framework of clans.

12:18.277 --> 12:20.817
Well, the reality is...
This wasn't so simple.

12:22.447 --> 12:24.317
The idealism of
my elder brother Hashirama...

12:24.407 --> 12:26.657
And the danger that Madara posed...

12:27.117 --> 12:29.317
Mediating between these two things,

12:29.407 --> 12:31.697
and protecting and
strengthening the village

12:31.777 --> 12:34.027
were my duties as
the Second Hokage.

12:38.117 --> 12:41.447
Shisui Uchiha was
a descendant of Kagami Uchiha.

12:42.277 --> 12:45.567
He was a friend of
your older brother Itachi.

12:46.737 --> 12:51.697
Many, including myself, embraced
the First Hokage's Will of Fire.

12:52.487 --> 12:56.737
But perhaps, I was more naïve
than any other shinobi.

12:56.987 --> 12:59.117
I wasn't able to continue
the Second Hokage's task

12:59.197 --> 13:00.867
of village-building skillfully enough.

13:01.447 --> 13:06.027
Which is how I ended up burdening Danzo
with the village's darkness.

13:06.907 --> 13:09.407
I killed Danzo in vengeance.

13:10.737 --> 13:13.817
Until the end, he spoke that
he would protect the village,

13:13.907 --> 13:15.697
no matter how dirty the means.

13:17.567 --> 13:22.447
It seems I've failed miserably
time after time as the Hokage.

13:22.907 --> 13:28.697
I guess I'm responsible for creating
the situation that exists now.

13:29.487 --> 13:31.697
No... You're not to blame, Lord Third.

13:31.867 --> 13:35.867
You did everything you could
for the sake of the village respectably.

13:36.317 --> 13:39.567
I'm the one who died during
the Nine Tails' attack on the village!

13:40.527 --> 13:42.867
You had such high hopes for me
as the Hokage...

13:44.197 --> 13:46.027
And I couldn't live up to them.

13:46.907 --> 13:50.617
I'll say... After he passed over me
and picked you.

13:51.237 --> 13:53.277
Everyone was so disappointed.

13:54.197 --> 13:57.027
Lord Orochimaru...
You sound like you're pouting.

13:58.487 --> 14:00.867
A little... since the Third Hokage
is right here.

14:01.567 --> 14:05.447
Had I lived, perhaps I could
have helped to foil

14:05.527 --> 14:08.867
the Uchiha's plans for
a coup d'état much sooner...

14:09.617 --> 14:12.527
Now then... Sasuke...

14:13.487 --> 14:14.907
What will you do?

14:16.617 --> 14:18.657
Will you destroy the village?

14:20.317 --> 14:21.617
Or...

14:37.107 --> 14:38.107
<i>Sorry, Sasuke...</i>

14:38.687 --> 14:39.897
<i>Let's do it some other time.</i>

14:40.357 --> 14:43.187
<i>Sorry, Sasuke. Let's do it next time...</i>

14:45.937 --> 14:47.277
<i>You probably hate me, huh?</i>

14:49.357 --> 14:52.687
<i>But, we only have each other</i>
<i>as siblings.</i>

14:53.437 --> 14:56.067
<i>I'm always going to</i>
<i>be there for you,</i>

14:56.147 --> 14:58.777
<i>even if it's only as an obstacle</i>
<i>for you to overcome.</i>

14:59.107 --> 15:00.817
<i>Even if you do hate me...</i>

15:02.317 --> 15:03.977
<i>That's what big brothers are for.</i>

15:08.067 --> 15:10.187
<i>You all suspect me?</i>

15:24.477 --> 15:28.937
<i>There is no value in killing you now...</i>
<i>my foolish little brother.</i>

15:29.477 --> 15:33.477
<i>If you wish to kill me,</i>
<i>resent me, hate me,</i>

15:33.567 --> 15:36.897
<i>and survive... in obscurity.</i>

15:44.107 --> 15:46.107
<i>I did what you said...</i>

15:46.607 --> 15:49.147
<i>I resented you and</i>
<i>hated you...</i>

15:49.727 --> 15:53.647
<i>and I survived just so I...</i>

15:54.147 --> 15:58.067
<i>so I could kill you!</i>

16:05.027 --> 16:07.567
<i>I have no interest</i>
<i>in someone like you...</i>

16:07.937 --> 16:11.817
<i>You're weak,</i>
<i>because you don't have enough...</i>

16:12.147 --> 16:13.437
<i>hate.</i>

16:25.727 --> 16:29.937
<i>I always lied to you and</i>
<i>asked you to forgive me.</i>

16:30.527 --> 16:33.227
<i>Deliberately keeping you at</i>
<i>a distance by my own hand.</i>

16:35.107 --> 16:37.607
<i>All because I didn't want you</i>
<i>to get caught up in any of this.</i>

16:38.937 --> 16:40.687
<i>But now, I believe...</i>

16:41.397 --> 16:43.977
<i>That perhaps you could have changed</i>

16:44.067 --> 16:48.527
<i>Father, Mother,</i>
<i>and the rest of the Uchiha.</i>

16:51.527 --> 16:54.107
<i>If I had been open with you</i>
<i>from the start...</i>

16:54.187 --> 16:58.027
<i>And looked you straight in the eyes</i>
<i>and told you the truth,</i>

16:59.397 --> 17:01.727
<i>then I wouldn't have had</i>
<i>to stand before you,</i>

17:01.817 --> 17:04.027
<i>from above, as a failure,</i>
<i>telling you all of this.</i>

17:05.107 --> 17:10.277
<i>So this time... I want to impart</i>
<i>this truth to you...</i>

17:11.857 --> 17:14.607
<i>You don't ever have to forgive me.</i>

17:16.357 --> 17:19.437
<i>And no matter what you do</i>
<i>from here on out, know this...</i>

17:20.727 --> 17:23.317
<i>I will love you always.</i>

17:32.107 --> 17:33.607
I'm going to the battlefield!

17:34.027 --> 17:37.897
I won't let the village,
and Itachi become nothing!

17:43.937 --> 17:44.857
It's been decided then!

17:45.317 --> 17:45.977
Tobirama!

17:46.227 --> 17:47.567
Prepare to fly us outside!

17:47.897 --> 17:51.067
Even if I wanted to use Flying Raijin,
I'm bound right now.

17:51.727 --> 17:54.107
Orochimaru, was it?
What will you do?

17:54.477 --> 17:58.147
You said earlier that
you'd follow Sasuke.

17:59.147 --> 18:02.857
Of course... We will accompany him.

18:02.937 --> 18:04.027
What?!

18:04.107 --> 18:06.027
J-Jugo, what about you?

18:06.027 --> 18:07.107
I'm going too.

18:08.027 --> 18:10.027
It's my job to protect Sasuke.

18:11.027 --> 18:12.857
<i>Four super-strong zombies...</i>

18:13.107 --> 18:14.437
<i>Three monsters...</i>

18:14.777 --> 18:17.897
<i>If I tag along, I'm dead for sure!</i>

18:18.357 --> 18:20.027
<i>I'm making a break for it</i>
<i>when I see a chance!</i>

18:23.777 --> 18:26.027
This view brings back memories!

18:28.067 --> 18:29.317
<i>It's now or never!</i>

18:29.937 --> 18:31.027
What the hell?!

18:31.107 --> 18:34.027
It's you after all, Sasuke!

18:34.607 --> 18:37.227
I sensed your chakra
and I couldn't believe it,

18:37.317 --> 18:39.027
so I backtracked and look what I find!

18:40.187 --> 18:40.937
Karin...

18:41.607 --> 18:46.817
Oh my... So many of my best experiments
gathered here in one place!

18:51.027 --> 18:52.147
You bastard...!

18:52.227 --> 18:54.317
I'll never forgive you!

18:54.527 --> 18:56.187
I'm sorry, Karin.

18:57.937 --> 19:03.527
You bastard! As if a simple apology
will get you off the hook...

19:03.607 --> 19:05.397
you good for nothing...

19:06.397 --> 19:10.227
I see you still have
a weakness for Sasuke, Karin...

19:10.937 --> 19:12.687
Listen, Lord Orochimaru!

19:12.857 --> 19:16.777
Sasuke... had the gall...
to stab me and...

19:16.897 --> 19:19.437
What a coincidence. Me too.

19:20.107 --> 19:22.477
But I'm helping Sasuke now.

19:23.027 --> 19:25.977
This is perfect timing. You help too.

19:26.107 --> 19:27.187
What?!

19:28.477 --> 19:29.937
I guess I have no choice...

19:30.147 --> 19:30.937
Who is she?

19:30.937 --> 19:32.897
Judging from the chakra
and that red hair...

19:32.977 --> 19:34.777
She's from the Uzumaki Clan.

19:34.937 --> 19:38.227
<i>One more idiot joins the pack.</i>

19:38.607 --> 19:40.777
<i>I bet Madara will be surprised.</i>

19:42.977 --> 19:44.187
Orochimaru...

19:44.277 --> 19:47.147
Why did you decide to help Sasuke?

19:47.477 --> 19:50.477
You were trying to destroy the village.

19:50.977 --> 19:53.937
After being inside Kabuto,
I realized something...

19:54.437 --> 19:58.607
He imitated the way I lived and
tried to possess everything,

19:58.687 --> 20:00.357
and failed.

20:01.067 --> 20:05.317
So now, I'm just curious about
the different path Sasuke has chosen.

20:06.067 --> 20:09.687
Unlike Kabuto, Sasuke didn't copy me.

20:11.027 --> 20:12.527
Fellow Hokage!

20:12.607 --> 20:14.277
As we stand atop the Great Stone Faces

20:14.357 --> 20:15.937
that have watched over
the Hidden Leaf...

20:15.937 --> 20:18.977
Let us burn this sight of
the village into our memory!

20:25.357 --> 20:27.067
<i>I'm finally going to see my son.</i>

20:27.147 --> 20:31.317
<i>Naruto, I wasn't able to do</i>
<i>anything for you as a father...</i>

20:31.397 --> 20:33.727
<i>I'll make it up to you by</i>
<i>bringing you a huge present.</i>

20:34.357 --> 20:36.937
All right! It's been a while
since my last war!

20:37.437 --> 20:39.647
I'd better be on my toes!

20:40.067 --> 20:42.857
Madara... We'll defeat you
this time for sure!

20:42.897 --> 20:44.437
This may sound foolish,

20:44.527 --> 20:48.027
but I'm kind of looking forward
to seeing my old friend!

20:48.977 --> 20:50.647
Just you wait, Madara!

20:51.357 --> 20:53.277
There's always conflict,
no matter what the era.

20:53.727 --> 20:56.527
But this shall be the end of wars!

20:57.027 --> 20:58.357
Let's go!

