22:37.747 --> 22:42.017
Obito, you once dreamed
of becoming Hokage.

22:42.657 --> 22:45.017
I can't see you not understanding
Naruto's feelings!

22:45.687 --> 22:47.057
You can still go back!

22:50.187 --> 22:53.307
It's because I understand
Naruto's mind...

22:54.797 --> 22:57.877
Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
"Hole"

22:58.337 --> 23:00.987
... that I want to negate everything
that he does!
